msgid "rules.abbreviation_label"
msgstr "Abbreviation"

msgid "rules.abbreviation_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.abbreviation_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.abbreviation_explanation"
msgstr "Sure your readers understand?"

msgid "rules.ability_label"
msgstr "Ability"

msgid "rules.ability_reason"
msgstr ""
"Communicates exclusion by stating that a person's abilities are outside of "
"an assumed definition of \"normal\"."

msgid "rules.ability_solution"
msgstr ""
"Rephrase in a way that talks about the person's ability without implying "
"otherness or disability."

msgid "rules.ability_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding disabilities"

msgid "rules.ableism_label"
msgstr "Ableist"

msgid "rules.ableism_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.ableism_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.ableism_explanation"
msgstr "Ableist"

msgid "rules.age_label"
msgstr "Age information"

msgid "rules.age_reason"
msgstr ""
"Asking for people's age puts them in a sensible spot and may provoke "
"stereotype threat."

msgid "rules.age_solution"
msgstr "Maybe you do not need to know their age?"

msgid "rules.age_explanation"
msgstr "Sure you need to ask for age?"

msgid "rules.age_in_jobs_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.age_in_jobs_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.age_in_jobs_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.age_in_jobs_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.age_old_label"
msgstr "50 years and older"

msgid "rules.age_old_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people 50 years "
"or older."

msgid "rules.age_old_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was 35 years old?\""

msgid "rules.age_old_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding age over 50"

msgid "rules.age_young_label"
msgstr "25 years and younger"

msgid "rules.age_young_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people 25 years "
"or younger."

msgid "rules.age_young_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was 45 years old?\""

msgid "rules.age_young_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding age below 25"

msgid "rules.agentic_label"
msgstr "Agentic"

msgid "rules.agentic_reason"
msgstr ""
"Unconsciously attributed to the male stereotype. Many do not feel attracted "
"by these terms."

msgid "rules.agentic_solution"
msgstr "Use team-oriented wording or referring to purpose."

msgid "rules.agentic_explanation"
msgstr "Doesn’t feel cooperative nor supportive"

msgid "rules.americanism_label"
msgstr "Americanism"

msgid "rules.americanism_reason"
msgstr ""
"May not be understood by readers who do not have an English language "
"education."

msgid "rules.americanism_solution"
msgstr "Use a word in your text's language."

msgid "rules.americanism_explanation"
msgstr "Americanism: Sure your readers understand?"

msgid "rules.antimuslim_label"
msgstr "Islamophobia"

msgid "rules.antimuslim_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.antimuslim_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.antimuslim_explanation"
msgstr "Islamophobic"

msgid "rules.antisemitism_label"
msgstr "Anti-Semitism"

msgid "rules.antisemitism_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.antisemitism_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.antisemitism_explanation"
msgstr "Anti-semitic"

msgid "rules.behavior_label"
msgstr "Behavior"

msgid "rules.behavior_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people "
"displaying behaviour outside of an assumed definition of “normal”."

msgid "rules.behavior_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was mentally fully  "
"healthy?\""

msgid "rules.behavior_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding behavior"

msgid "rules.belief_label"
msgstr "Belief"

msgid "rules.belief_reason"
msgstr ""
"Wording pigeonholing people of a certain belief or unconsciously expressing "
"one belief as the standard; thereby devaluing other beliefs."

msgid "rules.belief_solution"
msgstr ""
"Rephrase with words that do not transport any idea of belief or religion."

msgid "rules.belief_explanation"
msgstr "Expressing belief; not true for all"

msgid "rules.binary_pronouns_label"
msgstr "Binary Pronouns"

msgid "rules.binary_pronouns_reason"
msgstr ""
"Women or non-binary people do not feel addressed by the \"male generic\" and"
" their engagement decreases."

msgid "rules.binary_pronouns_solution"
msgstr ""
"Use the direct form of address (you). If you have to write in the third "
"person, use \"they\"."

msgid "rules.binary_pronouns_explanation"
msgstr "Pronouns according to binary understanding of gender"

msgid "rules.classism_label"
msgstr "Classism"

msgid "rules.classism_reason"
msgstr ""
"Can seem arrogant or incomprehensible since wording can be associated with a"
" power imbalance and/or noticeable difference in social class."

msgid "rules.classism_solution"
msgstr "Rephrase with a choice of words that's on eye-level."

msgid "rules.classism_explanation"
msgstr "Expresses power-imbalance"

msgid "rules.cognitive_ability_label"
msgstr "Cognitive ability"

msgid "rules.cognitive_ability_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people with "
"differences in cognitive ability."

msgid "rules.cognitive_ability_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person had no difference in "
"cognitive ability?\""

msgid "rules.cognitive_ability_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding cognitive ability"

msgid "rules.cognitive_perception_label"
msgstr "Cognitive perception"

msgid "rules.cognitive_perception_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people with "
"differences in cognitive perception."

msgid "rules.cognitive_perception_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person had no difference in "
"cognitive perception?\""

msgid "rules.cognitive_perception_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding cognitive perception"

msgid "rules.communal_label"
msgstr "Communal"

msgid "rules.communal_reason"
msgstr ""
"Emphasizes cooperative, compassionate or supportive characteristics and thus"
" inclusive attributes."

msgid "rules.communal_solution"
msgstr "Use more of such wording to express cooperation, care or purpose."

msgid "rules.communal_explanation"
msgstr "Emphasizes cooperative attributes"

msgid "rules.corporate_rules_label"
msgstr "Organization guideline"

msgid "rules.corporate_rules_reason"
msgstr "We always use subcategories here and so no need to fill anything in."

msgid "rules.corporate_rules_solution"
msgstr "We always use subcategories here and so no need to fill anything in."

msgid "rules.corporate_rules_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.culture_label"
msgstr "Culture"

msgid "rules.culture_reason"
msgstr ""
"Is a sweeping generalisation and traps people in outdated stereotypes."

msgid "rules.culture_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was of the dominant "
"national background?\""

msgid "rules.culture_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding cultural background"

msgid "rules.d_and_i_label"
msgstr "Diversity & Inclusion"

msgid "rules.d_and_i_reason"
msgstr ""
"Describes that diversity and inclusion is valued. As a public commitment "
"this is appreciated by underrepresented groups."

msgid "rules.d_and_i_solution"
msgstr ""
"Make it clear through your words, if possible, that diversity is desired in "
"your company and that you are working towards an inclusive culture."

msgid "rules.d_and_i_explanation"
msgstr "Emphasizes value of diversity, equity and inclusion"

msgid "rules.education_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.education_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.education_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.education_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.ethnicity_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.ethnicity_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.ethnicity_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.ethnicity_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.exaggerating_label"
msgstr "Exaggeration"

msgid "rules.exaggerating_reason"
msgstr "Communicates that people have to conform to these superlatives."

msgid "rules.exaggerating_solution"
msgstr "Use an authentic and honest sounding statement."

msgid "rules.exaggerating_explanation"
msgstr "Exaggeration: Perceived as pressure or arrogance"

msgid "rules.female_stereotype_label"
msgstr "Female Stereotype"

msgid "rules.female_stereotype_reason"
msgstr ""
"Traps women in outdated stereotypes. Hinders people to develop as they like."

msgid "rules.female_stereotype_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was male?\""

msgid "rules.female_stereotype_explanation"
msgstr "Branding women in traditional roles"

msgid "rules.filler_label"
msgstr "Filler Words"

msgid "rules.filler_reason"
msgstr ""
"Complicates the structure of the sentence and therefore becomes less "
"readable."

msgid "rules.filler_solution"
msgstr "Delete filler words."

msgid "rules.filler_explanation"
msgstr "Filler words make understanding harder"

msgid "rules.formality_label"
msgstr "Formality"

msgid "rules.formality_reason"
msgstr ""
"Depending on the working environment, such formal wording can lead to more "
"distance and is not conducive to cooperation at eye level."

msgid "rules.formality_solution"
msgstr "Try to write as if you were writing to a friend."

msgid "rules.formality_explanation"
msgstr "Formal wording creates emotional distance"

msgid "rules.function_label"
msgstr "Special functions"

msgid "rules.function_reason"
msgstr ""
"For economic-historical reasons, an image of a man is unconsciously evoked "
"in front of the inner eye, even if the term is linguistically neutral. The "
"female gender or other gender identities do not become visible. And they "
"will not feel to belong in this setting."

msgid "rules.function_solution"
msgstr ""
"In order to provoke an inclusive image, be not only linguistically, but also"
" mentally neutral in your formulation. Rather use a noun that describes the "
"activity. Or use a denomination that is truly gender-neutral."

msgid "rules.function_explanation"
msgstr "Image of a man unconsciously triggered"

msgid "rules.gen_boomer_label"
msgstr "Language Generation Boomer & X"

msgid "rules.gen_boomer_reason"
msgstr ""
"This combination of words may no longer be familiar to young people, as "
"language is always evolving."

msgid "rules.gen_boomer_solution"
msgstr ""
"Reflect on whether this expression is still in use outside your age group. "
"If not, try to formulate its meaning differently."

msgid "rules.gen_boomer_explanation"
msgstr "Seldom known wording of generation boomer"

msgid "rules.gen_z_label"
msgstr "Gen Z Language"

msgid "rules.gen_z_reason"
msgstr ""
"May not comprehensible to older generations, as typically used by Generation"
" Z."

msgid "rules.gen_z_solution"
msgstr ""
"Reflect on whether this expression is still in use outside your age group. "
"If not, try to formulate its meaning differently."

msgid "rules.gen_z_explanation"
msgstr "Wording of generation Z not known to all"

msgid "rules.gender_identity_label"
msgstr "Gender identity"

msgid "rules.gender_identity_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated and perhaps even discriminatory understanding of gender that "
"pigeonholes LGBTQIA+ people."

msgid "rules.gender_identity_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was female or male?\""

msgid "rules.gender_identity_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding gender identity"

msgid "rules.gendered_label"
msgstr "Gendered"

msgid "rules.gendered_reason"
msgstr ""
"Expressing or transporting either outdated gendered roles or meanings or a "
"binary view of gender."

msgid "rules.gendered_solution"
msgstr "Try to think beyond gendered roles or take a non-binary perspective."

msgid "rules.gendered_explanation"
msgstr "Getting stuck in gender normatives"

msgid "rules.gendered_denominations_ending_label"
msgstr "Inclusive ending"

msgid "rules.gendered_denominations_ending_reason"
msgstr "Consistent ending is more trustworthy."

msgid "rules.gendered_denominations_ending_solution"
msgstr ""
"Correct the spelling or adjust the setting for the “German Gender Ending” "
"according to the preference of Witty."

msgid "rules.gendered_denominations_ending_explanation"
msgstr "Non-consistent gender-ending"

msgid "rules.hearing_label"
msgstr "Hearing"

msgid "rules.hearing_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people with a "
"hearing disability."

msgid "rules.hearing_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person had their full hearing?\""

msgid "rules.hearing_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding hearing ability"

msgid "rules.hidden_image_label"
msgstr "Hidden meaning"

msgid "rules.hidden_image_reason"
msgstr ""
"Hides a form that is not gender-neutral and therefore calls up images with "
"masculine connotations in our mind's eye."

msgid "rules.hidden_image_solution"
msgstr "Use alternatives that are gender neutral while avoiding duplication."

msgid "rules.hidden_image_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden male generic"

msgid "rules.hollow_label"
msgstr "Empty Words"

msgid "rules.hollow_reason"
msgstr ""
"Is a hollow word because it has been overused in the business environment."

msgid "rules.hollow_solution"
msgstr ""
"Avoid using this word. Instead, explain the situation in a tangible and "
"descriptive way."

msgid "rules.hollow_explanation"
msgstr "Empty words have lost all meaning"

msgid "rules.homophobia_label"
msgstr "Homophobia"

msgid "rules.homophobia_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.homophobia_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.homophobia_explanation"
msgstr "Homophobe"

msgid "rules.inclusive_label"
msgstr "Inclusive"

msgid "rules.inclusive_reason"
msgstr "Is wording where people feel encouraged and get a sense of belonging."

msgid "rules.inclusive_solution"
msgstr ""
"Use more such wording to express cooperation, care, purpose, goal of "
"diversity and inclusion."

msgid "rules.inclusive_explanation"
msgstr "Creates sense of belonging"

msgid "rules.job_requirements_label"
msgstr "Biased Requirements"

msgid "rules.job_requirements_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.job_requirements_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.job_requirements_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.leadership_label"
msgstr "Leadership stereotype"

msgid "rules.leadership_reason"
msgstr ""
"Casts the topic of leadership in stereotypical male terms and traditionally "
"hierarchical."

msgid "rules.leadership_solution"
msgstr ""
"Use terms that assume a supportive notion of leadership and can mean "
"different genders."

msgid "rules.leadership_explanation"
msgstr "Traditional leadership vocabulary"

msgid "rules.learning_label"
msgstr "Learning ability"

msgid "rules.learning_reason"
msgstr ""
"Phrases that interpret a lack of good grades as a lack of motivation or "
"inherent ability, ignoring other factors shaping learning outcomes."

msgid "rules.learning_solution"
msgstr ""
"Could there be good reasons for the bad grades? How relevant is school "
"performance to completing the task at hand?"

msgid "rules.learning_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding learning ability"

msgid "rules.male_stereotype_label"
msgstr "Male Stereotype"

msgid "rules.male_stereotype_reason"
msgstr ""
"Traps men in outdated stereotypes. Hinders people to develop as they like."

msgid "rules.male_stereotype_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was female?\""

msgid "rules.male_stereotype_explanation"
msgstr "Branding men in traditional roles"

msgid "rules.medical_state_label"
msgstr "Medical state"

msgid "rules.medical_state_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people with a "
"medical condition."

msgid "rules.medical_state_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was fully healthy?\""

msgid "rules.medical_state_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding medical state"

msgid "rules.mental_wellbeing_label"
msgstr "Mental wellbeing"

msgid "rules.mental_wellbeing_reason"
msgstr ""
"Wordings that ignore people's mental well-being and portray their situation "
"or behaviour as \"not normal.”"

msgid "rules.mental_wellbeing_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person had good mental "
"wellbeing?\""

msgid "rules.mental_wellbeing_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding mental wellbeing"

msgid "rules.migration_label"
msgstr "Migration background"

msgid "rules.migration_reason"
msgstr ""
"Difficult to understand for people with a migration background, as they may "
"not understand certain idioms or bureaucratic language. Or it is a sweeping "
"generalisation and traps people in outdated stereotypes."

msgid "rules.migration_solution"
msgstr ""
"Rephrase with a simpler choice of words and short sentence. Ask yourself "
"\"What would I write if this person was of the dominant national "
"background?\""

msgid "rules.migration_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding migration background"

msgid "rules.military_source_label"
msgstr "Military source"

msgid "rules.military_source_reason"
msgstr ""
"Expressing a combative vision of the work environment. Those who have not "
"been in the military can only identify to a limited extent."

msgid "rules.military_source_solution"
msgstr "Choose cooperative wording."

msgid "rules.military_source_explanation"
msgstr "Military term expressing war-like ambiance"

msgid "rules.misgendering_institutions_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.misgendering_institutions_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.misgendering_institutions_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.misgendering_institutions_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.mobility_label"
msgstr "Mobility"

msgid "rules.mobility_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people with a "
"disability affecting their mobility."

msgid "rules.mobility_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person had their full mobility?\""

msgid "rules.mobility_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding mobility"

msgid "rules.openly_discriminating_label"
msgstr "Openly discriminating"

msgid "rules.openly_discriminating_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.openly_discriminating_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.openly_discriminating_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.orthography_label"
msgstr "Orthography"

msgid "rules.orthography_reason"
msgstr ""
"Correct any spelling or grammatical errors to maximize the impact of their "
"writing."

msgid "rules.orthography_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.orthography_explanation"
msgstr "Orthography"

msgid "rules.overload_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.overload_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.overload_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.overload_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.passive_voice_label"
msgstr "Passive Voice"

msgid "rules.passive_voice_reason"
msgstr "Limits approachability."

msgid "rules.passive_voice_solution"
msgstr "Write in active voice."

msgid "rules.passive_voice_explanation"
msgstr "Passive voice creates emotional distance"

msgid "rules.pressure_label"
msgstr "Pressure"

msgid "rules.pressure_reason"
msgstr "Communicates pressure and thus is a sign of \"having to fit in\"."

msgid "rules.pressure_solution"
msgstr "Formulate at eye level, as you being an equal part of your team."

msgid "rules.pressure_explanation"
msgstr "Expresses pressure"

msgid "rules.racism_label"
msgstr "Racism"

msgid "rules.racism_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.racism_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.racism_explanation"
msgstr "Racist"

msgid "rules.racist_source_label"
msgstr "Racist source"

msgid "rules.racist_source_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated and perhaps even discriminatory pigeonholing a particular ethnic "
"background."

msgid "rules.racist_source_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person belonged to the dominant "
"ethnic background in my society?\""

msgid "rules.racist_source_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding skin color"

msgid "rules.salary_vague_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.salary_vague_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.salary_vague_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.salary_vague_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.sexism_label"
msgstr "Sexism"

msgid "rules.sexism_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.sexism_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.sexism_explanation"
msgstr "Mysogynist"

msgid "rules.sexual_orientation_label"
msgstr "Sexual orientation"

msgid "rules.sexual_orientation_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated and perhaps even discriminatory understanding of sexual orientation"
" that pigeonholes LGBTQIA+ people and transporting heterosexuality as the "
"norm."

msgid "rules.sexual_orientation_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was heterosexual?\""

msgid "rules.sexual_orientation_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding sexual orientation"

msgid "rules.speech_label"
msgstr "Speech ability"

msgid "rules.speech_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people with a "
"speech disability."

msgid "rules.speech_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person has now speech "
"impairment?\""

msgid "rules.speech_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding speech ability"

msgid "rules.sports_terms_label"
msgstr "Sports terms"

msgid "rules.sports_terms_reason"
msgstr ""
"Expressing a competitive vision of the working environment. Those who are "
"not sporty can only identify themselves to a limited extent."

msgid "rules.sports_terms_solution"
msgstr "Choose cooperative wording."

msgid "rules.sports_terms_explanation"
msgstr "Sports term expresses competitive ambiance"

msgid "rules.style_label"
msgstr "Style"

msgid "rules.style_reason"
msgstr ""
"Difficult to understand or limited in approachability and emotionality."

msgid "rules.style_solution"
msgstr "Formulate in simpler terms, try to bring in more emotionality."

msgid "rules.style_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.technical_frameworks_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.technical_frameworks_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.technical_frameworks_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.technical_frameworks_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.titles_label"
msgstr "Titles"

msgid "rules.titles_reason"
msgstr ""
"The male generic does not speak to all genders or gender identities. Many "
"people therefore do not feel included in the dialogue."

msgid "rules.titles_solution"
msgstr ""
"Use words that address the female gender as well as gender identities that "
"do not follow a binary understanding of gender."

msgid "rules.titles_explanation"
msgstr "Male generic doesn’t address all genders"

msgid "rules.transphobia_label"
msgstr "Transphobia"

msgid "rules.transphobia_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.transphobia_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.transphobia_explanation"
msgstr "Transphobic"

msgid "rules.unconscious_bias_label"
msgstr "Biased language"

msgid "rules.unconscious_bias_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated and perhaps even discriminatory stereotype that pigeonholes members"
" of the social group."

msgid "rules.unconscious_bias_solution"
msgstr ""
"Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person was of a strong social "
"group?\""

msgid "rules.unconscious_bias_explanation"
msgstr "Word communicating bias, in a hidden way"

msgid "rules.verbose_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.verbose_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.verbose_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.verbose_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.vision_label"
msgstr "Vision"

msgid "rules.vision_reason"
msgstr ""
"Outdated, hidden or even discriminatory wording pigeonholing people with a "
"medical consition or disability impacting their sight."

msgid "rules.vision_solution"
msgstr "Ask yourself \"What would I write if this person had full sight?\""

msgid "rules.vision_explanation"
msgstr "Hidden bias regarding vision ability"

msgid "rules.workload_label"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.workload_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.workload_solution"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.workload_explanation"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.xenophobia_label"
msgstr "Xenophobia"

msgid "rules.xenophobia_reason"
msgstr ""

msgid "rules.xenophobia_solution"
msgstr "Don't use this expression. You strongly offend people."

msgid "rules.xenophobia_explanation"
msgstr "Xenophobic"
